@startuml BaseView Workflow

!theme crt-amber

title BaseView - Code Flow and Actions

participant "Application" as app
participant "BaseView" as base
participant "AppState" as state

== Initialization ==
app -> base: AddView<BaseView>(app, render_priority)
base -> base: OnAdd()
base --> app: View added

== Render Loop ==
app -> base: OnIterate()
base -> state: Get application state
state --> base: State reference
base --> app: Iteration done

app -> base: OnRender()
base -> base: Render base UI elements
base --> app: Rendering done

== Cleanup ==
app -> base: OnRemove()
base --> app: Cleanup complete

@enduml
